00:51:56.040 --> 00:52:02.040
Kent Dybvig: Which interface are you referring to? The contract? Like, is this for cross-contract calls, or is this…

466
00:52:02.040 --> 00:52:03.810
Andrzej Kopeć: Yes, yes, yes.

467
00:52:08.970 --> 00:52:12.940
Thomas Kerber: So what… what is this… Oh, you can't hear me. Okay.

