00:52:14.790 --> 00:52:21.149
Thomas Kerber: Oh! Oh, okay. Magically, things just start working. Okay, great.

471
00:52:22.560 --> 00:52:26.039
Thomas Kerber: What has this done for in the Ethereum space?

