00:54:08.030 --> 00:54:10.960
Kent Dybvig: something really did happen, because I think that's…

488
00:54:11.080 --> 00:54:18.229
Kent Dybvig: that's necessary anyway. You can't… you can't assume that just because something was logged, that it actually did happen.

489
00:54:18.800 --> 00:54:22.490
Kent Dybvig: So I think double-checking is part of the… is part of the advice.

