00:54:29.180 --> 00:54:44.850
Kevin Millikin: Yeah, I was just gonna say that having the events be part of the interface seems really sort of weird to me. Like, if you declare… they're a little bit like the checked exceptions in Java. If you declare that you're going to log an event, you don't necessarily log that event on all paths through the circuit, because you don't.

