00:55:00.810 --> 00:55:01.620
Andrzej Kopeć: So…

496
00:55:01.730 --> 00:55:03.119
Kevin Millikin: Participating in this protocol.

497
00:55:03.570 --> 00:55:07.539
Andrzej Kopeć: the… the semantics I had in mind were more like…

498
00:55:07.830 --> 00:55:17.030
Andrzej Kopeć: In case it is declared, then at least one event of a particular shape needs to be omitted to satisfy the interface.

499
00:55:19.120 --> 00:55:24.940
Andrzej Kopeć: Or… or exactly one, but… to go…

500
00:55:25.250 --> 00:55:30.199
Andrzej Kopeć: the other direction than the checked exceptions, work in Java.

