504
00:55:54.220 --> 00:56:00.879
Thomas Kerber: And maybe… Put it this way, I would at least want to separate it out as a concern.

505
00:56:01.320 --> 00:56:11.109
Thomas Kerber: Because I think we'd need to understand what Ethereum does here, and what people expect, how it… what people expect from it.

